# Generated eval material: verbatim questions and answer snippets from the
# private archive. The scripts regenerate it locally from whatever corpus you
# have - the DATA must never land in this public repo.
# Deliberately a WILDCARD, not a list of filenames. A named list only covers
# the variants that existed when it was written, and one stray variant
# (eval_cases_notemporal.json) was already sitting untracked and unignored.
benchmarks/eval_*
benchmarks/graded_*
benchmarks/plan_*.sql
benchmarks/judge.log
!benchmarks/eval_pool_SCHEMA.md

# Local abstention cases name real clients - keep them out of the public repo.
# Commit abstention_hard.example.json instead.
benchmarks/abstention_hard.json
